is cozy suite features modern mix of ash/white tones with high gloss cabinetry within the beautiful kitchen. Plenty of storage and counter top space with large centre island, high end stainless steel appliances, stone countertops, and recessed lighting. Grande master bedroom with walk in closet and built in shelving, and a luxury main bathroom with mixed shower/soaker tub, tiled backsplash and large vanity. The den is a perfect size for office or space guest suite. Wrap around windows for plenty of natural light. Large private patio overlooking the quiet interior of the complex. One secured parking included. (id:67604)"},"30354625":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264959945800000/reb89/highres/4/R3171574_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264959945800000/reb89/highres/4/R3171574_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264959945800000/reb89/highres/4/R3171574_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264959945800000/reb89/highres/4/R3171574_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264959945800000/reb89/highres/4/R3171574_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264959945800000/reb89/highres/4/R3171574_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264959945800000/reb89/highres/4/R3171574_7.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264959945800000/reb89/highres/4/R3171574_8.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264959945800000/reb89/highres/4/R3171574_9.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264959945800000/reb89/highres/4/R3171574_10.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264959945800000/reb89/highres/4/R3171574_11.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264959945800000/reb89/highres/4/R3171574_12.jpg"],"remarks":"Welcome to this Pitt Meadows gem! This beautiful furnished 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom townhouse in Regency Court offers nearly 1,500 square ft of comfortable, turn-key living. Tucked in a quiet residential enclave in central Pitt Meadows, yet steps from the West Coast Express station and minutes from Save-On-Foods, shops, cafes and dining, with easy Lougheed Highway access and quick connections via the Golden Ears Bridge to Surrey and Langley. One designated parking stall, and BC Hydro included up to $120/month for easy budgeting. Dogs considered with owner approval. Available mid-December 2026 on a furnished fixed term through April/May 2027 (id:67604)"},"30366865":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639269220973470000/reb89/highres/2/R3172452_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639269221003200000/reb89/highres/2/R3172452_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639269221003970000/reb89/highres/2/R3172452_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639269220994000000/reb89/highres/2/R3172452_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639269220980000000/reb89/highres/2/R3172452_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639269220991400000/reb89/highres/2/R3172452_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639269220990830000/reb89/highres/2/R3172452_7.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639269220980000000/reb89/highres/2/R3172452_8.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639269220990200000/reb89/highres/2/R3172452_9.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639269220989700000/reb89/highres/2/R3172452_10.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639269220991470000/reb89/highres/2/R3172452_11.jpg"],"remarks":"Brand-new, unfurnished 1-bedroom, 1-bathroom semi-basement suite with a private entrance. Approximately 350 sq. ft., featuring a dishwasher and private in-suite laundry. Utilities included; no separate utility meters. Approximately a 7-minute walk to Marine Gateway, with T&T Supermarket, Shoppers Drug Mart, restaurants and cafés nearby. Convenient access to Marine Drive Canada Line Station and the South Vancouver Bus Loop for connections to Downtown Vancouver, Richmond and YVR. Pet friendly and available immediately. Credit check and tenant insurance required. (id:67604)"},"30368161":{"photos":["https://ddfc