er and lower decks. Spacious rancher with fully developed lower level and flexible open-concept layout, ideal for family or multigenerational living. Three generous bedrooms each with it's own ensuite. Two bright dens overlooking beautifully landscaped backyard with mature fruit trees. EV charging hookup, carport and ample off-street parking. Near parks, playgrounds, schools, SFU. Tenant Insurance required at move-in. (id:67604)"},"30450337":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639287207788170000/reb89/highres/4/R3179014_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639287207788170000/reb89/highres/4/R3179014_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639287207788170000/reb89/highres/4/R3179014_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639287207788170000/reb89/highres/4/R3179014_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639287207788170000/reb89/highres/4/R3179014_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639287207788170000/reb89/highres/4/R3179014_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639287207788170000/reb89/highres/4/R3179014_7.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639287207788170000/reb89/highres/4/R3179014_8.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639287207788170000/reb89/highres/4/R3179014_9.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639287207788170000/reb89/highres/4/R3179014_10.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639287207788170000/reb89/highres/4/R3179014_11.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639287207788170000/reb89/highres/4/R3179014_12.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639287207788170000/reb89/highres/4/R3179014_13.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639287207788170000/reb89/highres/4/R3179014_14.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639287207788170000/reb89/highres/4/R3179014_15.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639287207788170000/reb89/highres/4/R3179014_16.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639287207788170000/reb89/highres/4/R3179014_17.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS63