op terrace designed for entertaining. 2 parking stalls with private EV charging, XL private storage room, integrated shoe storage, cabinetry and 2nd fridge on 3rd level. Amenities include tennis court, gym, dog park, sauna, party lounge. Conveniently located by Rocky Point Park, breweries, Inlet Skytrain, shops, and restaurants. (id:67604)"},"30454129":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639289674497000000/reb89/highres/8/R3179318_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639289674497200000/reb89/highres/8/R3179318_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639289674478770000/reb89/highres/8/R3179318_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639289674497270000/reb89/highres/8/R3179318_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639289674468400000/reb89/highres/8/R3179318_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639289674517600000/reb89/highres/8/R3179318_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639289674517630000/reb89/highres/8/R3179318_7.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639289674517500000/reb89/highres/8/R3179318_8.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639289674519430000/reb89/highres/8/R3179318_9.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639289674517500000/reb89/highres/8/R3179318_10.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639289674517530000/reb89/highres/8/R3179318_11.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639289674517570000/reb89/highres/8/R3179318_12.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639289674517430000/reb89/highres/8/R3179318_13.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639289674519330000/reb89/highres/8/R3179318_14.jpg"],"remarks":"976 sf 2-level loft style penthouse, 1 bed + den, 1.5 baths, ample outdoor space Main floor is 676 sq ft. & features a fully equipped kitchen, den for office use, living/dining area with a gas fireplace, powder room, insuite laundry and storage under the stairs. Small deck off of living room. Upstairs is 300 square ft with primary bedroom, walk in closet & 4 pcs ensuite. Entrance to large 262 sq ft. roof top patio off of bedroom, perfect for entertaining. Comes with 1 parking stall/1 storage locker. Great Central Lonsdale location. Unit comes unfurnished (*Some photos virtually staged). (id:67604)"},"30459553":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639289036698530000/reb6/highres/3/R3179813_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639289036698530000/reb6/highres/3/R3179813_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639289036698530000/reb6/highres/3/R3179813_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639289036698530000/reb6/highres/3/R3179813_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639289036698530000/reb6/highres/3/R3179813_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639289036698530000/reb6/highres/3/R3179813_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639289036698530000/reb6/highres/3/R3179813_7.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639289036698530000/reb6/highres/3/R3179813_8.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639289036698530000/reb6/highres/3/R3179813_9.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639289036698530000/reb6/highres/3/R3179813_10.jpg"],"remarks":"Looking to rent out the upstairs portion of this lovely 3-bedroom, 1.5-bathroom home, nestled in a sought-after East Abbotsford neighborhood. Designed for comfortable above-ground living, this bright and welcoming home offers an abundance of natural light and a refreshing, open feel throughout. One of the standout features is that the entire home offers a bright and comfortable living and conveniently close to reputable schools, parks, shopping centers, restaurants, and other essential amenities. For more information or to schedule a viewing, please contact Harji Bassi @604-725-8094. (id:67604)"},"30478081":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639293902788130000/reb89/highres/9/R3181149_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639293902788130000/reb89/highres/9/R3181149_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639293902788130000/reb89/highres/9