299410971070000/reb89/highres/0/R3183170_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299410971070000/reb89/highres/0/R3183170_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299410971070000/reb89/highres/0/R3183170_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299410971070000/reb89/highres/0/R3183170_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299410971070000/reb89/highres/0/R3183170_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299410971070000/reb89/highres/0/R3183170_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299410971070000/reb89/highres/0/R3183170_7.jpg"],"remarks":"Kitsilano charming two-bedroom garden suite blending modern comfort with inviting outdoor living. The fully renovated interior features an open kitchen and living area, contemporary cabinetry, stainless steel appliances, a dishwasher, laminate flooring and recessed lighting. Two comfortable bedrooms, an updated bathroom and in-suite laundry complete the home. Double patio doors open onto a private fenced patio offering approximately 150 sqft. of outdoor space-an inviting setting for morning coffee, summer dining or relaxing at the end of the day. Enjoy a sought-after Kitsilano location just steps from West Broadway´s shops, restaurants, Safeway and transit, with parks and recreation nearby. Utilities are included in the rent. 1 pet okay and permit street parking is available. (id:67604)"},"30502081":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299880228300000/reb89/highres/0/R3183200_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299880228300000/reb89/highres/0/R3183200_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299880228300000/reb89/highres/0/R3183200_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299880228300000/reb89/highres/0/R3183200_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299880228300000/reb89/highres/0/R3183200_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299880228300000/reb89/highres/0/R3183200_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299880228300000/reb89/